reading the set
  acts   ! release · e edit · A archive · B assign · s sort · v arrange · f filter · . excluded · / find
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first version, G / g e last version]
  full   [! release this version, enter fold a header, e edit this version, A archive or unarchive it, B put it on issues, or take it off]
  full   [s sort the versions, v group by cross-space release or project, f filter by state or project, . show or hide what the plan excludes, / find a version or release]
counting what is open on one
  acts   e edit · A archive · B assign · s sort · v arrange · f filter · . excluded · / find
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, g g first version, G / g e last version]
  full   [enter fold a header, e edit this version, A archive or unarchive it, B put it on issues, or take it off]
  full   [s sort the versions, v group by cross-space release or project, f filter by state or project, . show or hide what the plan excludes, / find a version or release]
typing a version
  acts   ctrl+s save · esc leave it
  full   [tab next field, shift+tab previous field]
  full   [ctrl+s save this version, esc leave it alone]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
a save in flight
  acts   
choosing an order
  acts   ←/h prev · →/l next · enter choose · esc cancel
  full   [←/h previous field, →/l next field]
  full   [enter choose this order, esc leave the order as it is]
typing the text filter
  acts   enter keep · esc clear
  full   [enter keep the text, esc clear it]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
choosing the filters
  acts   tab next · ←/h prev value · →/l next value · enter keep
  full   [tab next filter, shift+tab previous filter]
  full   [←/h previous value, →/l next value]
  full   [enter keep them, esc keep them]
